[{"client_msg_id":"40e566a7-c32a-47a9-89e9-ffb9c29bd25c","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"Storeからインストールしたアプリをコピーして再インストールするのを禁止するのに必須、としたいんじゃないかなぁと推測してる。その起点となるセキュアモジュール","ts":"1624936714.275800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NwVYv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"90fe922a-a236-4c10-91cd-98863ac7a420","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"とはいえ、じゃあ今まだ触ってないコードにTPM2.0必須処理がないと言えるかってーと","ts":"1624936345.274500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rW0E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"efd25ee3-f094-4eb6-a4aa-c897fa278579","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"意味のない制限はクラックされる運命なんだよな","ts":"1624936212.274100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yab"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d9748f07-16c9-44f2-8a28-0f24dbe6d118","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"\u0026gt; Microsoftの承認があれば\nゴニョられて突破される未来が見える","ts":"1624936180.273900","edited":{"user":"U8CC7MDCL","ts":"1624936187.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M0ky"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5728e715-ec03-472e-8209-d57dad04beb1","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"\u003chttps://gigazine.net/news/20210628-windows-11-without-tpm-requirement/\u003e","ts":"1624935874.273400","attachments":[{"fallback":"GIGAZINE: 一部PCは「TPM 2.0をサポートしていないのにWindows 11がインストールされている」と判明、中国やロシア向けの製品か","id":1,"title":"一部PCは「TPM 2.0をサポートしていないのにWindows 11がインストールされている」と判明、中国やロシア向けの製品か","title_link":"https://gigazine.net/news/20210628-windows-11-without-tpm-requirement/","text":"2021年6月25日、MicrosoftがWindowsの次期メジャーバージョンとなる「Windows 11」を発表しました。Windows 11は「トラステッド・プラットフォーム・モジュール(TPM)のサポート」が必須システム要件とされていますが、「Microsoftの承認があればTPMをサポートしてなくてもWindows 11をインストールできる」ことが明らかになりました。TPMをサポートしないのにも関わらずWindows 11がインストールされるPCは、中国やロシア向けのプロダクトの可能性があると報じられています。","image_url":"https://i.gzn.jp/img/2021/06/28/windows-11-without-tpm-requirement/00.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"GIGAZINE","service_icon":"https://gigazine.net/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://gigazine.net/news/20210628-windows-11-without-tpm-requirement/","original_url":"https://gigazine.net/news/20210628-windows-11-without-tpm-requirement/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NJcC="}]},{"client_msg_id":"10ecd8f3-4f5c-4603-a4a8-c3080c427d0c","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"まぁここまでいろいろ出てるけど、正直リリースされてもしばらくはアプデしないだろうな","ts":"1624932296.273100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EdqZA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3195e54b-82fd-4a63-a4ed-d142ea8f5cac","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ストレージは確かに今小さくてちょっと考えたいんだよなぁ。システムドライブは M.2 なんだけど 160GB しかない。それとは別で 4TB の HDD はあるけど、システムドライブが意外に容量食ってて割とカツカツ","ts":"1624929755.271000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ixnr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb7b885e-1a7c-40f0-837a-d6c79c6a5b57","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://www.itmedia.co.jp/pcuser/articles/2106/29/news064.html\u003e\nなんとなくPreviewで調査、みたいなニュアンスが強めなのかなという気が","ts":"1624929718.269900","attachments":[{"fallback":"ITmedia PC USER: Windows 11のInsider Previewは「第7世代Core」「初代Ryzen」をサポート　システム要件の調整を目的に","id":1,"title":"Windows 11のInsider Previewは「第7世代Core」「初代Ryzen」をサポート　システム要件の調整を目的に","title_link":"https://www.itmedia.co.jp/pcuser/articles/2106/29/news064.html","text":"Windows Insider Programの開発者チャンネルに、Windows 11のInsider Previewが配信された。Windows 11に実装される主な新機能に対応するが、CPU／SoCとTPMチップに関する要件が緩和されている。","image_url":"https://image.itmedia.co.jp/pcuser/articles/2106/29/l_si7101-MS-01.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"ITmedia PC USER","service_icon":"https://www.itmedia.co.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.itmedia.co.jp/pcuser/articles/2106/29/news064.html","original_url":"https://www.itmedia.co.jp/pcuser/articles/2106/29/news064.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LlBr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9fbfe2c3-e2d4-453c-90ef-a525a47e47f1","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"自分の場合だとストレージと石だけ新調するのでもいいかな\nどうせここまで変わるならいっそクリーンインストールしたいので","ts":"1624929611.268700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xgl0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c4e95f6-960c-4fc0-8816-bc765d21e8a3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"つまり私のマシンでも特に部品買い換えずに動きそうだな。 ~パーティションを MBR から GPT に移行する必要はあるが~ :innocent:","ts":"1624929540.267600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oyq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0bd2e96d-6c83-41e6-98ce-0083fc0484b2","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"それでもKabyか\nM/Bは対応してるので最悪石だけ買えば動くけど、それならいっそ新調したい気持ちがある","ts":"1624929370.266800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x/JVh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f55ba85-757c-454e-bb9e-e4e3efd95ca0","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ついにきた","ts":"1624929057.265800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lQ4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"77489012-d600-442d-a053-cc9378166eb8","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"\u003chttps://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1334/629/|https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1334/629/\u003e","ts":"1624929053.265600","attachments":[{"fallback":"PC Watch: Windows 11の最小システム要件が緩和、第7世代Core/Zen 1のRyzenも対象に","id":1,"title":"Windows 11の最小システム要件が緩和、第7世代Core/Zen 1のRyzenも対象に","title_link":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1334/629/","text":"　米Microsoftは28日(現地時間)、Windows 11の最小システム要件を更新し、新たに第7世代Coreプロセッサおよび初代Ryzenのシステムもサポートすることを明らかにした。","image_url":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/img/pcw/list/1334/629/1.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1624927722,"service_name":"PC Watch","service_icon":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1334/629/","original_url":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1334/629/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mGv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d07e4ed2-763f-494c-a2cd-a6390cc13091","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"CPUのそのもののアーキテクチャについては、まあ文句いわれやすそうだけど\n周辺のいろいろ考えると、どうしてもねえ...","ts":"1624928999.265200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BgWp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b29709b4-01dd-421d-bbf8-4e75cfbc2ed9","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"Intel Core、どうしても地続きみたいな感覚があるんですよね","ts":"1624928637.264300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d805o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"399d7827-714b-49dc-ae38-014afaa750fc","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"AMDはZen以前のアーキテクチャは切って当然みたいなところあるのに…Intel+Windows、カワイソウ。","ts":"1624928580.263600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BAll"}]},{"client_msg_id":"761d36e3-485e-434c-8c39-b91f0660744e","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"Zen1で動いてくれると私はうれしい","ts":"1624928556.262400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fjq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b21c864-e824-40ac-8ff8-5317a398da04","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"TPMついていてよかった","ts":"1624928544.261700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O1FRm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d4b0f199-6258-4fdf-b99e-c84411f1922c","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ギリギリ対応されるかどうかですね","ts":"1624928538.261500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"de